00:14:27,366 --> 00:14:28,409
{\an8}Halt!

241
00:14:29,868 --> 00:14:32,121
Damn it. I need to stop it…

242
00:14:33,080 --> 00:14:34,290
<i>Baywatcher, come in.</i>

243
00:14:34,373 --> 00:14:36,625
{\an8}<i>Planet Earth imminent.</i>
<i>If that thing breaches…</i>

244
00:14:36,709 --> 00:14:38,294
{\an8}BAYWATCHER HQ - DOME'S BAY

245
00:14:38,377 --> 00:14:40,462
Got it. I will stop it.

246
00:14:40,546 --> 00:14:42,715
-<i>Watch out, Baywatcher!</i>
-What?

247
00:14:47,678 --> 00:14:49,513
{\an8}THE PRESENT

248
00:14:49,597 --> 00:14:51,348
Whatever could that be?

249
00:14:51,432 --> 00:14:53,601
My! Who is this strange-looking man?

250
00:14:53,684 --> 00:14:55,352
Good golly, he must be a criminal!

251
00:14:56,020 --> 00:14:58,689
But that is no reason
not to tend to his wounds.

252
00:14:58,772 --> 00:15:00,524
For I am a nurse!

253
00:15:02,109 --> 00:15:03,527
Goodness, he is coming to.

254
00:15:03,611 --> 00:15:05,321
Where am I?

255
00:15:05,404 --> 00:15:06,780
Why, Daten City.

256
00:15:07,364 --> 00:15:08,449
Daten City?

257
00:15:09,491 --> 00:15:10,618
This place is foreign to me.

258
00:15:10,701 --> 00:15:11,744
Wait…

259
00:15:12,328 --> 00:15:15,414
What's my name? Who even am I?

260
00:15:15,497 --> 00:15:17,916
More dots. More dots. Come on, more dots.

261
00:15:18,500 --> 00:15:19,835
This is terrible.

262
00:15:19,918 --> 00:15:22,630
He keeps shooting those dot beams.
It is impossible to move.

263
00:15:22,713 --> 00:15:24,131
Apologies. I am now present.

264
00:15:24,715 --> 00:15:25,799
-Panty!
-Uh-oh.

265
00:15:26,759 --> 00:15:27,885
Sorry for the delay.

266
00:15:27,968 --> 00:15:29,553
So then your mirth has ended?

267
00:15:29,637 --> 00:15:32,056
I have noticed something.

268
00:15:32,139 --> 00:15:34,433
Look at his forehead.

269
00:15:34,516 --> 00:15:37,269
Notice the black geometric cube.

270
00:15:38,145 --> 00:15:39,229
You are correct!

271
00:15:39,313 --> 00:15:41,857
{\an8}I think perhaps
that may be part of the Ghost.

272
00:15:41,940 --> 00:15:43,192
{\an8}You say ghost controlling?

273
00:15:43,275 --> 00:15:45,194
Affirmative! That must be it.

274
00:15:45,277 --> 00:15:49,615
Understood. Then I will distract
the Ghost by saying mean things.

275
00:15:49,698 --> 00:15:52,409
Then you grab it, and destroy it. Okay?

276
00:15:52,493 --> 00:15:54,620
You know what to do. So do it.

277
00:15:54,703 --> 00:15:56,330
Here I go! You can count on me!

278
00:15:56,413 --> 00:15:59,291
He must be the sole descendant
of some farming entity.

279
00:15:59,375 --> 00:16:01,085
He has the eyes of a heifer.

280
00:16:01,168 --> 00:16:03,629
Mention that,
and you are bound to hit a sore spot.

281
00:16:03,712 --> 00:16:05,089
Okay!

282
00:16:05,172 --> 00:16:07,383
Tired. So tired.

283
00:16:07,466 --> 00:16:09,301
Hey! Over here! You piece of cow pat!

284
00:16:09,385 --> 00:16:13,222
Your cow trespassed on my property
and damaged my perimeter vegetation.

285
00:16:13,722 --> 00:16:16,100
Animal behavior strongly correlates
with that of its owner.

286
00:16:16,725 --> 00:16:20,062
I suspect any wealth of yours
is nothing but ill-gotten gains!

287
00:16:20,646 --> 00:16:22,523
Do I offend you? Then come at me bro!

288
00:16:22,606 --> 00:16:26,026
That tongue of yours
is askin' for trouble, kid.

289
00:16:26,985 --> 00:16:28,654
-Quickly…
-Hold still, ya hellion!

290
00:16:28,737 --> 00:16:30,572
Good. The time is now.

291
00:16:30,656 --> 00:16:32,408
-Panty!
-What?

292
00:16:32,491 --> 00:16:34,993
-Stocking!
-Crocodile!

293
00:16:35,077 --> 00:16:36,328
Uh-oh!

294
00:16:40,082 --> 00:16:41,250
What happened?

295
00:16:41,333 --> 00:16:43,544
You were being controlled by a Ghost.

296
00:16:43,627 --> 00:16:47,005
But wait. We broke the black thing,
but I do not hear that bell.

297
00:16:47,089 --> 00:16:49,091
Moreover, I have not
changed back to normal.

298
00:16:49,174 --> 00:16:51,427
-You okay?
-I feel sick…

299
00:16:52,469 --> 00:16:55,347
-What?
-Are you all right, Panty?

300
00:16:55,431 --> 00:16:57,558
I detect another minor shift in structure.

301
00:16:57,641 --> 00:17:00,477
What if just continue life?

302
00:17:00,561 --> 00:17:03,021
Feel better than normal, I do.

303
00:17:03,105 --> 00:17:04,690
You are not wrong.

304
00:17:06,108 --> 00:17:09,987
-Ghosts are not entirely devoid of merit.
-Crocodile, crocodile, crocodile.

305
00:17:11,071 --> 00:17:13,031
{\an8}THE NEXT DAY

306
00:17:18,996 --> 00:17:20,873
It's a revelation!

307
00:17:21,457 --> 00:17:22,750
Are you all right, my dear?

308
00:17:22,833 --> 00:17:25,377
I remember everything.
My name is Baywatcher.

309
00:17:25,461 --> 00:17:28,046
And furthermore, I have a mission!

310
00:17:29,006 --> 00:17:31,258
I hope I'm not too late!

311
00:17:34,344 --> 00:17:35,888
Something is descending, Panty!

312
00:17:35,971 --> 00:17:37,097
You are correct.

313
00:17:37,681 --> 00:17:40,184
Halt! I am not your enemy.

314
00:17:41,643 --> 00:17:45,063
The enemy is up there. Baywatch!

315
00:17:46,648 --> 00:17:51,278
<i>Little old maw-maw, her hips go…</i>

316
00:17:52,029 --> 00:17:53,822
My name is Tekki!

317
00:17:54,406 --> 00:17:56,700
Oh! Whatever was I doing?

318
00:17:56,784 --> 00:18:00,412
I have to get back to crab fishing
in the Bering Sea right away!

319
00:18:00,496 --> 00:18:01,622
-Whoosh.
-What is going on?

320
00:18:01,705 --> 00:18:05,584
My name is Baywatcher.
I am a Ghost Hunter.

321
00:18:05,667 --> 00:18:07,419
Technically, I am a Space Ghost Hunter.

322
00:18:07,503 --> 00:18:09,338
But that is not the point!

323
00:18:09,421 --> 00:18:11,256
It must be destroyed immediately.

324
00:18:11,340 --> 00:18:13,133
The universe is in grave danger!

325
00:18:13,217 --> 00:18:14,218
"It"?

326
00:18:14,301 --> 00:18:17,137
The Cosmic Monolith Cube
Mother Space Ghost.

327
00:18:17,221 --> 00:18:20,557
It is a Ghost born from the ill-will
of a fourth-dimensional being

328
00:18:20,641 --> 00:18:22,267
who perished via the anti-mojo code!

329
00:18:22,351 --> 00:18:25,896
It distorts time and space,
New Gaddessifying everything in its wake.

330
00:18:25,979 --> 00:18:28,482
What happens
when you are New Gaddessified?

331
00:18:28,565 --> 00:18:31,193
All sexual desire becomes nullified.

332
00:18:31,276 --> 00:18:32,778
All mojo, the essence of life, gone.

333
00:18:32,861 --> 00:18:33,904
That is a grim future.

334
00:18:33,987 --> 00:18:36,824
In fact, I too have not masturbated
nor had intercourse since yesterday.

335
00:18:36,907 --> 00:18:39,284
Shared sweets with beast!

336
00:18:39,368 --> 00:18:40,369
{\an8}Rude. Am not beast!

337
00:18:40,452 --> 00:18:42,955
But I must say,
the way it's spreading is peculiar.

338
00:18:43,038 --> 00:18:45,749
Perhaps this planet
aids in amplifying its power--

339
00:18:45,833 --> 00:18:48,502
Wait! Panty! Your angel halo is missing!

340
00:18:49,086 --> 00:18:50,170
You don't say?

341
00:18:50,254 --> 00:18:51,630
Look ridiculous.

342
00:18:51,713 --> 00:18:53,382
-Yours is missing too.
-Missing?

343
00:18:53,465 --> 00:18:55,384
And where have our demon tails gone?

344
00:18:55,467 --> 00:18:56,510
{\an8}This is not my tail. Wait.

345
00:18:56,593 --> 00:18:57,636
{\an8}Whose tail is this?

346
00:18:57,719 --> 00:18:58,887
The process is now clear!

347
00:18:58,971 --> 00:19:02,391
It is feeding on your powers
and repurposing it to fuel its growth.

348
00:19:04,643 --> 00:19:06,562
We can linger no longer.

349
00:19:06,645 --> 00:19:10,524
If we do not defeat the Cube Ghost,
the universe will collapse into ruin!

350
00:19:10,607 --> 00:19:12,484
Baywatch!

351
00:19:13,318 --> 00:19:14,528
Amazing!

352
00:19:14,611 --> 00:19:18,198
Come, my friends!
I give my life to save this world!

353
00:19:20,158 --> 00:19:22,744
The Ghost is within our grasp.

354
00:19:22,828 --> 00:19:24,454
Hold on tight, and don't let go--

355
00:19:24,538 --> 00:19:25,539
Oh no! Help me!

356
00:19:28,917 --> 00:19:30,711
-Help me!
-Crocodile!

357
00:19:30,794 --> 00:19:32,337
Bad! Cannot--

358
00:19:32,421 --> 00:19:34,298
Are we to taste defeat?

359
00:19:34,798 --> 00:19:37,384
Your advice, Baywatcher!
If the current trajectory persists…

360
00:19:40,637 --> 00:19:42,848
Baywatcher, no…

361
00:19:42,931 --> 00:19:45,475
You cannot!

362
00:19:45,559 --> 00:19:48,228
Everything… It's all my fault…

363
00:19:48,729 --> 00:19:51,773
I crashed into the meteorite,
and I failed to catch the Ghost.

364
00:19:52,274 --> 00:19:54,818
I must correct this error,
even if it costs me my life.

365
00:19:55,319 --> 00:19:57,446
I will return your powers to you!

366
00:19:59,865 --> 00:20:04,620
Baywatch!

367
00:20:12,252 --> 00:20:13,879
Watch!

368
00:20:20,302 --> 00:20:23,555
Now it is up to you…

369
00:20:31,772 --> 00:20:33,607
-Repent!
-Return to the dark!

370
00:20:36,610 --> 00:20:38,445
Fuck! That was some serious crazy shit.

371
00:20:38,528 --> 00:20:40,197
Never. Never again.

372
00:20:40,280 --> 00:20:42,157
You were pretty funny to look at though.

373
00:20:42,240 --> 00:20:44,076
-Shut up, bitch!
-That was disturbing.

374
00:20:44,159 --> 00:20:45,786
Not so fast, you guys.

375
00:20:45,869 --> 00:20:47,913
I still don't hear any bells ringing.

376
00:20:48,664 --> 00:20:49,915
Bell?

377
00:20:54,169 --> 00:20:55,170
Whoa…

378
00:21:11,895 --> 00:21:13,438
<i>I am revived.</i>

379
00:21:13,522 --> 00:21:15,190
A MYSTERIOUS VOICE
ECHOES THROUGH THE VOID

380
00:21:15,273 --> 00:21:17,526
<i>Listen, Panty.</i>
<i>I cannot be the hero this world needs.</i>

381
00:21:17,609 --> 00:21:19,695
<i>Everything has been New Gaddessified.</i>

382
00:21:19,778 --> 00:21:22,364
<i>It is likely to remain so forever more.</i>

383
00:21:22,447 --> 00:21:25,075
<i>But I can send you back into the past.</i>

384
00:21:25,575 --> 00:21:28,495
<i>I can give your gun the power</i>
<i>to transcend time and space.</i>

385
00:21:28,578 --> 00:21:32,332
<i>Shoot, and your bullet will transcend</i>
<i>time and space to send you into the past.</i>

386
00:21:32,416 --> 00:21:36,420
<i>Traverse the timeline to a point</i>
<i>prior to my arrival on this planet,</i>

387
00:21:36,503 --> 00:21:39,464
<i>and destroy the Ghost!</i>

388
00:21:39,965 --> 00:21:40,966
{\an8}YESTERDAY

389
00:21:41,049 --> 00:21:42,092
{\an8}Halt!

390
00:21:56,690 --> 00:21:58,358
<i>Whoa! Now something else is appearing!</i>

391
00:21:58,859 --> 00:22:01,069
<i>Holy cow! It's a cow!</i>

392
00:22:01,153 --> 00:22:03,405
<i>I repeat!</i>
<i>We have a cow and a farmer in our midst!</i>

393
00:22:11,538 --> 00:22:13,915
There's more to come, isn't there?

394
00:22:13,999 --> 00:22:17,169
Are you… Are you from the future?

395
00:22:17,794 --> 00:22:21,381
The Cube Ghost may be destroyed,
but that wasn't its true form.

396
00:22:21,465 --> 00:22:24,885
The Ghost actually
resides in the black dots.

397
00:22:24,968 --> 00:22:26,887
That is the true anti-mojo code.

398
00:22:27,387 --> 00:22:30,057
-Am I right?
-Yes.

399
00:22:30,640 --> 00:22:34,436
We, the Space Ghost Hunters,
intend to annihilate them all.

400
00:22:34,519 --> 00:22:36,688
I will annihilate them myself.

401
00:22:37,814 --> 00:22:38,940
But you have…

402
00:22:39,608 --> 00:22:40,901
<i>I know.</i>

403
00:22:40,984 --> 00:22:43,862
<i>This world may be my past,</i>

404
00:22:44,571 --> 00:22:47,741
<i>but it's future does not belong to me.</i>

405
00:22:48,366 --> 00:22:49,910
And so, I--

406
00:22:49,993 --> 00:22:51,536
You are wrong.

407
00:22:51,620 --> 00:22:54,790
Your future belongs to you.

408
00:23:02,005 --> 00:23:03,173
You're right.

409
00:23:11,765 --> 00:23:13,934
-Let's go!
-Right.

410
00:23:17,145 --> 00:23:18,939
What the hell was that for, slut?

411
00:23:19,523 --> 00:23:21,525
Hey, I'm talkin' to you, bitch!

412
00:24:52,908 --> 00:24:54,910
{\an8}Subtitle: Daisy Savage & Rychelle Brittain
